sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as Application
    participant Ca as Cache
    participant DB as Database
    rect rgb(240,247,255)
        Note over App,DB: cache-aside read
        App->>Ca: get(key)
        alt hit
            Ca-->>App: value
        else miss
            App->>DB: read
            DB-->>App: row
            App->>Ca: set with TTL
        end
    end
    rect rgb(255,248,230)
        Note over App,DB: write, and the invalidation that keeps it honest
        App->>DB: write
        App->>Ca: delete the key
        Note over App,Ca: delete, not update — an update races with concurrent readers
    end
    rect rgb(255,235,238)
        Note over App,DB: the two failure modes
        App->>Ca: many misses on one hot key
        Note over App,DB: stampede — one loader per key, others wait
        App->>Ca: a whole cohort expires together
        Note over App,DB: avalanche — spread TTLs with jitter
    end
